@startuml
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
title SIC/XE assembler - high-level structure

top to bottom direction

component "Assembler API\nassemble / assembleDetailed" as API
component "Engine\nper-assembly state" as Engine
component "Line parser\nparseLine" as Parser
component "Statement vector\nsource order" as Statements
component "ISA catalog\ninstructions and directives" as ISA
component "Pass 1\nlayout and symbols" as Pass1
component "Pass 2\nbytes and listing" as Pass2
component "Value evaluation\nopaque dependency" as Values
component "CodeMemory\nsparse initialized bytes" as Memory
component "AssemblyInfo\ndiagnostics, symbols,\nrelocations, source map" as Info
component "SIC/XE loader" as Runtime
component "Language service" as Language

API --> Engine
Engine --> Parser
Parser --> ISA
Parser --> Statements
Statements --> Pass1
ISA --> Pass1
Pass1 --> Pass2
Values --> Pass1
Values --> Pass2
Pass2 --> Memory
Pass1 --> Info
Pass2 --> Info
Memory --> Runtime
Info --> Runtime
Info --> Language

note right of Engine
  Owns location counter, symbols,
  diagnostics, BASE/ORG state,
  output and metadata for one run.
end note

note right of Values
  Expression parser/evaluator
  internals are intentionally
  outside this high-level view.
end note

note bottom of Info
  assembleDetailed returns both
  outputs. assemble() stores the
  metadata and throws on errors.
end note
@enduml
